&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/charmbracelet/glow/raw/master/LICENSE&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
